# [chat-alerts] Chat alerts

## What to build

Post a message to the configured chat channel when an item is parked, so an
operator can unpark it before the next digest.

Spec `chat-alerts` of epic `operator-notifications`.

## Requirements

- [ ] **Park alert**: post within a minute of an item being parked.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Park alert: the message names the item and why it was parked.

## Where

- Repo: `demo`

## Depends on

- Blocked by `nightly-digest` — Nightly digest email

